Alembic migrations.

The database URL is taken from settings.DATABASE_URL (.env), not from alembic.ini.

Common commands (run from the backend/ directory or inside the api container):
    alembic upgrade head                      # apply all migrations
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "msg"  # create a new migration from models
    alembic downgrade -1                       # revert the last migration
